msgid "Your Wii U games: .wua, .wud, .wux, or folders with code, content and meta. Encrypted .wud and .wux need their keys in /data/ps5cemu/keys.txt."
msgstr "I tuoi giochi Wii U: .wua, .wud, .wux, o cartelle con code, content e meta. I .wud e .wux criptati richiedono le loro chiavi in /data/ps5cemu/keys.txt."

msgid "Where your 3DS games are. Cross picks another."
msgstr "Dove sono i tuoi giochi 3DS. Croce ne sceglie un’altra."

msgid "Your 3DS games: .3ds or .cci, .cxi, .3dsx and Azahar's compressed dumps, decrypted, here or in the folders in it. CIA files are installed (Install CIA files). Encrypted dumps need the 3DS's aes_keys.txt in /data/ps5cemu/azahar/sysdata."
msgstr "I tuoi giochi 3DS: .3ds o .cci, .cxi, .3dsx e i dump compressi di Azahar, decriptati, qui o nelle sue sottocartelle. I file CIA si installano (Installa file CIA). I dump criptati richiedono l’aes_keys.txt del 3DS in /data/ps5cemu/azahar/sysdata."

